{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vhMZsMetgn1795422412.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國際刑警組織全體大會下周舉行，警方指，屆時灣仔北一帶全面封路，全港亦設禁飛區，就算放風箏都違法。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207867-%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%E5%88%91%E8%AD%A6%E7%B5%84%E7%B9%94%E5%A4%A7%E6%9C%83%E4%B8%8B%E5%91%A8%E8%88%89%E8%A1%8C%E7%81%A3%E4%BB%94%E5%8C%97%E4%B8%80%E5%B8%B6%E5%B0%87%E5%B0%81%E8%B7%AF%E5%85%A8%E6%B8%AF%E8%A8%AD%E7%A6%81%E9%A3%9B%E5%8D%80%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E7%9B%B4%E5%8D%87%E6%A9%9F%E5%8F%8A%E9%A2%A8%E7%AE%8F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>國際刑警組織大會下周舉行灣仔北一帶將封路　全港設禁飛區包括直升機及風箏</strong></a></p><p></p><p>行會成員陳健波獲委任為新任醫管局主席，接替范鴻齡，任期下月一日起生效，為期兩年。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207858-%E9%99%B3%E5%81%A5%E6%B3%A2%E4%B8%8B%E6%9C%88%E6%8E%A5%E4%BB%BB%E9%86%AB%E7%AE%A1%E5%B1%80%E4%B8%BB%E5%B8%AD%E7%A8%B1%E5%B0%87%E8%88%87%E9%86%AB%E8%A1%9E%E5%B1%80%E8%A8%82%E5%AE%9A%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%E6%87%89%E5%B0%8D%E9%86%AB%E7%99%82%E9%96%8B%E6%94%AF%E7%BA%8C%E5%8D%87%E7%AD%89%E6%8C%91%E6%88%B0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>陳健波下月接任醫管局主席　稱將與醫衞局訂定策略應對醫療開支續升等挑戰</strong></a></p><p></p><p>為打擊非法餵飼野鴿，漁護署引入人工智能(AI)監察系統及巡邏機械人，會透過記錄的影像部署行動，強調鏡頭不設人臉識別功能。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207911-%E6%BC%81%E8%AD%B7%E7%BD%B2%E5%BC%95%E5%85%A5AI%E7%9B%A3%E5%AF%9F%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1%E5%8F%8A%E5%B7%A1%E9%82%8F%E6%A9%9F%E6%A2%B0%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%93%E6%93%8A%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E9%A4%B5%E9%A3%BC%E9%87%8E%E9%B4%BF%E5%BC%B7%E8%AA%BF%E9%8F%A1%E9%A0%AD%E4%B8%8D%E8%A8%AD%E4%BA%BA%E8%87%89%E8%AD%98%E5%88%A5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>漁護署引入AI監察系統及巡邏機械人打擊非法餵飼野鴿　強調鏡頭不設人臉識別</strong></a></p><p></p><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審。鄺港智承認與蔡天鳳離婚後，2023年仍有性關係。他指譚方駿可能知道，但無反對，他形容三人像家人，但同時又很複雜及奇怪，又否認因怒火殺死蔡天鳳。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207850-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E6%99%BA%E8%88%87%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E8%AD%9A%E6%96%B9%E9%A7%BF%E5%83%8F%E5%AE%B6%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%99%82%E5%8F%88%E5%BE%88%E8%A4%87%E9%9B%9C%E5%8F%8A%E5%A5%87%E6%80%AA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜鄺港智：與蔡天鳳、譚方駿像家人　同時又很複雜及奇怪</strong></a></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207909-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E6%99%BA%E6%8C%87%E8%A2%AB%E8%94%A1%E8%B2%AC%E7%BD%B5%E6%98%AF%E6%83%85%E8%B6%A3%E5%90%A6%E8%AA%8D%E5%9B%A0%E6%80%92%E7%81%AB%E6%AE%BA%E6%AD%BB%E5%B0%8D%E6%96%B9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜鄺港智指被蔡責罵是「情趣」　否認因怒火殺死對方</strong></a></p><p></p><p>第二艘國產大型郵輪「愛達‧花城號」展開商業首航，抵達本港。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207852-%E5%9C%8B%E7%94%A2%E5%A4%A7%E5%9E%8B%E9%83%B5%E8%BC%AA%E6%84%9B%E9%81%94%E8%8A%B1%E5%9F%8E%E8%99%9F%E5%B1%95%E9%96%8B%E5%95%86%E6%A5%AD%E9%A6%96%E8%88%AA%E6%8A%B5%E9%81%94%E6%9C%AC%E6%B8%AF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>國產大型郵輪「愛達‧花城號」展開商業首航　抵達本港</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T10:03:55.605231+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":486,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T19:12:58.404141+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:57:16.256235+00:00","content_hash":"c9490f7c1c1a877dd7dfee2ff3de77d21088ae24c0f379303543d972d08070a6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T10:03:55.605231+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}